      "created_at": "2015-07-21T23:26:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Block gaurd causes any target damaged by it to not be able to deal damage. Any way to redirect damage from it (via synaptic, or wrest the mind) is very good for locking down the villian, especially if it's a villian whose character card is the main one dealing the damage (plague rat, Iron Legacy, Apostate, Ambuscade, etc.)</p>",
